			"Message": "docs(Vine): Rewrite README with consolidated tables and modern structure\n\nRemove the decorative HTML header/logo table and restructure the Vine README from a verbose, scattered layout into focused sections with tables. Key changes include: a compact Overview that folds in Key Features and Deep Dive prose, new Key Components and Service Definitions tables with file paths and gRPC method signatures, a Port Allocation table mapping processes to ports/protocols, an API Reference section, and a Related Documentation section with internal cross-links. The funding sponsor logo grid is replaced with a clean inline row, stale sections (Building & Running, standalone Changelog) are removed, and the footer is streamlined to a single line.\n\nThe result is a leaner, more scannable README that accurately reflects Vine's current state as a placeholder for protocol definitions and documents the real component locations.",
